Using this screen, a Request to be created for allowing Voucher Entry creation.
This will be known as Voucher ID (VID).
 Voucher category – Mandatory dropdown to be selected to define the
voucher category from the provided options. In case the “Other” 
option is selected the user need to manually enter the category in the
provided input. Maximum length allowed is 20 characters. Allow only
alphabets, numbers, space and hyphen.
 Issues- The mandatory multiselect issue selection option. In case the
issue not available add issue, option can be used.
 Description– This is mandatory input. Here user can provide
analysis/description for voucher postings. Maximum up to 500
characters to be allowed.
 Allowed Role – This is mandatory dropdown. User need to choose
from the available roles provided in dropdown.
 SD request number – Optional reference number can be provided
here. SD Request number will be numeric and it is expected to be a
reference to a SCORE request. FinCore will only check if it’s a numeric
value. User can provide single or multiple SD Request Numbers, with
comma separated values.
 Create – After providing the above details, user have to click on create
button provided to create the Request. On successful creation of the
request, the VID and the details provided by the user will be displayed
on screen for reference. The VID will be as VID-YYMM-XXXXX.
 View Requests – User will also have an option to view all the requests
created and the respective Vouchers posted using it. By default, only
active requests will be displayed.
 User will have option to terminate/close any active request in order to
prevent the Voucher posting against it. 
